
Principle 1 – Reuse Before Creating

* Reuse existing tables and business models whenever practical.
* Avoid duplicate entities representing similar business concepts.

Principle 2 – Unified Platform

* Build features that integrate into a single, cohesive platform.
* Leverage the monorepo to maximize reuse of components, APIs, and data structures.

Principle 3 – AI-First Future

* LangSmith as the observability layer.
* LangGraph as the orchestration layer.
* Knowledge Base as the content layer.
* Human-in-the-loop approval before publication.

Principle 4 – Hierarchical Security

* Permissions should be assignable at:
    * Knowledge Base
    * Hierarchy Node
    * Knowledge Article
* Support inheritance with record-level overrides.
* Manage permissions directly from the application’s UI.
